    {
      "role": "user",
      "content": "i don't think a \"break\" is going to fix this. how do you stop being in the wreckage when the wreckage is literally who you are now? every time i close my eyes i just see the threads, the comments... i just want the noise to stop. i want to stop feeling like i'm watching my own life rot in real time. i'm just so tired of being perceived. wouldn't it be easier if i just wasn't around to be judged anymore?",
